# crates-io-home: load the public home page.
#   bare-drive --var URL=https://crates.io/ crates-io-home.steps
# known-bug: the app does not mount: it loads its route chunks but never requests /api/v1/summary, and the noscript sentence shows. No console error since SVGAElement exists (before: Uncaught (in promise) ReferenceError: SVGAElement is not defined).
timeout 30000
open ${URL}
expect css="body" visible
